    "mainCount": 1,
    "visibleText": "Skip to main content\n✦\nSeed Sprint\nDemo\nPrivacy\nHow to play\n\nONE BOARD EVERY UTC DAY\n\nRace the same signal puzzle\n\nFor puzzle friends who want one fair five-minute board without accounts or schedules.\n\nTry it with sample data\nOpens a partly solved practice board.\nFree to play\nWorks offline after your first visit\nProgress stays on this device\nTODAY\n2026-09-02\n·\n·\n◆\n·\n·\n·\n·\n·\n·\n♣\n·\n◆\n·\n·\n·\n·\n·\n◆\nToday’s board is ready\nFinish before the five-minute clock ends.\nPlay today’s board\n\nSAME SEED. DIFFERENT ROUTE.\n\nHow it works\nRotate the tiles.\nJoin every line from the seeds to the sprout.\nBeat five minutes.\nThe board is the same for everyone that day.\nShare your result.\nSend a spoiler-safe card or the board link.\nA small daily game\n\nThere is no chat, account, live lobby, or endless puzzle feed.\n\nYour play stays here\n\nThe game saves progress in this browser. Shared links include only the seed, time, turns, and result.\n\nSeed Sprint is a five-minute daily signal puzzle.\n\nPrivacy\nTerms\nBuilt by Param Factory\n(external site)\n\nVersion 1.0.0 · Hero image generated for this game.\n\nRace the same signal puzzle",
